# The tools .github/workflows/pypi.yml builds the PyPI package with. The build
# runs without an isolated environment (python -m build --no-isolation), so
# these, pinned by version and hash in requirements-pypi.txt, are exactly what
# it uses. Dependabot (pip ecosystem, /packaging) proposes updates; to
# regenerate by hand, from this folder:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --no-emit-index-url --strip-extras -o requirements-pypi.txt requirements-pypi.in
build
setuptools
wheel
